# systemd journald message catalog for component: database_manager

-- 4c8a1023e5b94d719f012a34c8b5e101
Subject: Database initialization failed at component boundary
Defined-By: target_layout_extended::database_manager
Support: https://github.com/JeffKarling/Target_Layout_Extended

The database_store::initialize boundary call failed because the supplied path
was empty or an existing database file could not be parsed.

-- 4c8a1023e5b94d719f012a34c8b5e102
Subject: Item insertion rejected at component boundary
Defined-By: target_layout_extended::database_manager
Support: https://github.com/JeffKarling/Target_Layout_Extended

The database_store::add_item boundary call rejected an Item record because its
required id field was empty or memory allocation failed.

-- 4c8a1023e5b94d719f012a34c8b5e103
Subject: Database serialization to disk failed
Defined-By: target_layout_extended::database_manager
Support: https://github.com/JeffKarling/Target_Layout_Extended

The database_store::save_to boundary call could not write the Protobuf snapshot
because the parent directory does not exist, lacks write permission, or failed
during stream serialization.

-- 4c8a1023e5b94d719f012a34c8b5e104
Subject: Database deserialization from disk failed
Defined-By: target_layout_extended::database_manager
Support: https://github.com/JeffKarling/Target_Layout_Extended

The database_store::load boundary call encountered a corrupted or unreadable
Protobuf file on disk.
